Revision: bf279c4e1a96684c650fcbf34db4b78b2b94dce6 (trunk, 1999-11-02), the
  last revision before the 2.9-ee-991111 snapshot the game's SDK compiler was
  built from.

  file        upstream path    sha1
  libgcc2.c   gcc/libgcc2.c    df72c899e710ef83b5cc9f641a437fd29174c5c9
  longlong.h  gcc/longlong.h   031fdc4d962a7a24c6e015d869bd280c8c4e3fc9
